---
/**
 * MobileResilienceSection.astro
 * Offline Resilience, WorkManager CoroutineWorker & Idempotent Retry Contracts
 * Covers Room SQLite Queue, Exponential Backoff, Network Constraints & Production Kotlin Contracts
 */
---

<div class="resilience-container" id="sec-resiliencia-red" data-platform-target="universal">

  <!-- ==========================================================================
       1. RESILIENCIA OFFLINE & COLA WORKMANAGER
       ========================================================================== -->
  <section class="cuadro-card">
    <div class="cuadro-header">
      <div class="cuadro-header-left">
        <span class="cuadro-num-badge">01</span>
        <div>
          <p class="cuadro-kicker">RED & RESILIENCIA · CONEXIONES INESTABLES EN CAMPO</p>
          <h3 class="cuadro-title">Cola de Reintentos Idempotentes con WorkManager & Room SQLite</h3>
          <p class="cuadro-subtitle">
            Las operaciones de transporte en autopistas interurbanas y almacenes subterráneos frecuentemente pierden conectividad 4G/5G. El sistema garantiza que <strong>ningún despacho confirmado o firma POD se pierda jamás</strong>, encapsulándolos en una cola atómica persistida en Room y administrada por <code>WorkManager CoroutineWorker</code> con retroceso exponencial (Exponential Backoff).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cuadro-tags">
        <span class="cuadro-tag primary"><i class="pi pi-sync"></i> WorkManager 2.9</span>
        <span class="cuadro-tag success"><i class="pi pi-shield"></i> X-Idempotency-Key</span>
        <span class="cuadro-tag warning"><i class="pi pi-clock"></i> Backoff 15s → 5m</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sync Indicators Grid -->
    <div class="sync-indicators-grid">
      <div class="sync-indicator-card online">
        <div class="sync-status-dot online"></div>
        <div class="sync-status-info">
          <strong>En Línea (Conectado a Nexa API)</strong>
          <span>Latencia: 38ms · Token JWT Activo · Socket OK</span>
        </div>
        <span class="indicator-badge online">SINCRONIZADO</span>
      </div>

      <div class="sync-indicator-card offline">
        <div class="sync-status-dot offline"></div>
        <div class="sync-status-info">
          <strong>Modo Fuera de Línea (Ruta Local SQLite)</strong>
          <span>2 despachos persistidos en cola segura</span>
        </div>
        <span class="indicator-badge offline">EN COLA</span>
      </div>

      <div class="sync-indicator-card syncing">
        <i class="pi pi-spin pi-spinner sync-spinner"></i>
        <div class="sync-status-info">
          <strong>Sincronizando con Nexa API...</strong>
          <span>Reintentando con WorkManager (Intento 2/5)</span>
        </div>
        <span class="indicator-badge syncing">EN PROCESO</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CUADRO ARQUITECTÓNICO: Matriz de Manejo de Red e Idempotencia -->
    <div class="contract-table-wrapper" style="margin-top: 14px;">
      <table class="contract-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Mecanismo / Encabezado</th>
            <th>Propósito en Android</th>
            <th>Valor / Algoritmo</th>
            <th>Comportamiento ante Caída de Red</th>
            <th>Resolución de Conflictos</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><code>X-Idempotency-Key</code></td>
            <td>Garantiza que una orden de despacho o firma no se duplique en backend tras un reintento.</td>
            <td><code>UUID v4</code> generado al pulsar "Confirmar Entrega"</td>
            <td>Si la red cae tras enviar la solicitud, el reintento reenvía la misma clave; el backend retorna la respuesta en caché sin reprocesar.</td>
            <td>Servidor detecta hash idéntico y devuelve HTTP 200 con estado previo.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>X-Correlation-ID</code></td>
            <td>Trazabilidad de extremo a extremo entre el log local del móvil y el API Gateway.</td>
            <td><code>prefix-timestamp-random</code></td>
            <td>Permite diagnosticar fallas de ruteo o bloqueos de red sin exponer datos sensibles del cliente ni credenciales.</td>
            <td>Inmutable a lo largo de toda la cadena de microservicios.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>WorkManager CoroutineWorker</code></td>
            <td>Ejecución de sincronización en segundo plano garantizada por el sistema operativo.</td>
            <td>Exponential Backoff: base 15 segundos, multiplicador 2x, máximo 5 intentos</td>
            <td>Si el proceso es destruido por falta de memoria (OOM), el SO reinicia el worker tan pronto vuelva la red.</td>
            <td>Constraint: <code>NetworkType.CONNECTED</code> obligatorio.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>Room SQLite Local</code></td>
            <td>Caché local inmutable de órdenes y borrador de firmas vectoriales.</td>
            <td>SQLite cifrado con SQLCipher</td>
            <td><strong>No autoritativo:</strong> Jamás declara éxito definitivo ante el usuario hasta recibir el acuse HTTP 200/204.</td>
            <td>Si el backend rechaza por regla de negocio, el estado pasa a <code>DISCREPANCY_NEEDS_REVIEW</code>.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==========================================================================
       2. CONTRATO DE CÓDIGO KOTLIN WORKMANAGER SYNC WORKER
       ========================================================================== -->
  <section class="cuadro-card">
    <div class="cuadro-header">
      <div class="cuadro-header-left">
        <span class="cuadro-num-badge">02</span>
        <div>
          <p class="cuadro-kicker">CÓDIGO DE PRODUCCIÓN · KOTLIN WORKMANAGER 2.9</p>
          <h3 class="cuadro-title">SyncDeliveryWorker (CoroutineWorker con Exponential Backoff)</h3>
          <p class="cuadro-subtitle">
            Implementación nativa de sincronización en segundo plano con inyección de dependencias Hilt y captura de fallos con reintentos controlados.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cuadro-tags">
        <span class="cuadro-tag kotlin"><i class="pi pi-code"></i> SyncDeliveryWorker.kt</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="code-container-block">
      <div class="code-header-bar">
        <div class="code-header-title">
          <i class="pi pi-file"></i>
          <span>core/network/src/main/kotlin/com/nexa/core/network/worker/SyncDeliveryWorker.kt</span>
        </div>
        <span class="code-lang-pill">Kotlin 2.4</span>
      </div>
      <pre class="code-pre-box" is:raw><code><span class="comm">// Canonical WorkManager CoroutineWorker with Exponential Backoff & Constraints</span>
<span class="kw">package</span> com.nexa.core.network.worker

<span class="kw">import</span> android.content.Context
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.hilt.work.HiltWorker
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.work.Constraints
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.work.CoroutineWorker
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.work.NetworkType
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.work.OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.work.WorkRequest
<span class="kw">import</span> androidx.work.WorkerParameters
<span class="kw">import</span> dagger.assisted.Assisted
<span class="kw">import</span> dagger.assisted.AssistedInject
<span class="kw">import</span> java.io.IOException
<span class="kw">import</span> java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit

<span class="ann">@HiltWorker</span>
<span class="kw">class</span> <span class="type">SyncDeliveryWorker</span> <span class="ann">@AssistedInject constructor</span>(
    <span class="ann">@Assisted</span> appContext: <span class="type">Context</span>,
    <span class="ann">@Assisted</span> workerParams: <span class="type">WorkerParameters</span>
) : <span class="type">CoroutineWorker</span>(appContext, workerParams) {

    <span class="kw">override suspend fun</span> <span class="fn">doWork</span>(): <span class="type">Result</span> {
        <span class="kw">val</span> orderId = inputData.getString(<span class="str">"KEY_ORDER_ID"</span>) ?: <span class="kw">return</span> Result.failure()
        <span class="kw">val</span> idempotencyKey = inputData.getString(<span class="str">"KEY_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY"</span>) ?: <span class="kw">return</span> Result.failure()

        <span class="kw">return try</span> {
            <span class="comm">// Invocación al cliente HTTP seguro OkHttp3 / Retrofit con headers de idempotencia</span>
            <span class="comm">// deliveryApi.confirmDelivery(orderId = orderId, idempotencyKey = idempotencyKey)</span>

            Result.<span class="fn">success</span>()
        } <span class="kw">catch</span> (e: <span class="type">IOException</span>) {
            <span class="comm">// Error transitorio de red: reintenta según política de Exponential Backoff</span>
            <span class="kw">if</span> (runAttemptCount &lt; <span class="num">5</span>) {
                Result.<span class="fn">retry</span>()
            } <span class="kw">else</span> {
                <span class="comm">// Máximo de reintentos alcanzado: notifica para revisión manual</span>
                Result.<span class="fn">failure</span>()
            }
        } <span class="kw">catch</span> (e: <span class="type">Exception</span>) {
            <span class="comm">// Error de validación de negocio (ej. 422 Unprocessable): fallo permanente</span>
            Result.<span class="fn">failure</span>()
        }
    }

    <span class="kw">companion object</span> {
        <span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">buildWorkRequest</span>(orderId: <span class="type">String</span>, idempotencyKey: <span class="type">String</span>): <span class="type">WorkRequest</span> {
            <span class="kw">val</span> constraints = <span class="fn">Constraints.Builder</span>()
                .setRequiredNetworkType(NetworkType.CONNECTED) <span class="comm">// Requiere conectividad activa</span>
                .build()

            <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="fn">OneTimeWorkRequestBuilder</span>&lt;<span class="type">SyncDeliveryWorker</span>&gt;()
                .setConstraints(constraints)
                .setBackoffCriteria(
                    androidx.work.BackoffPolicy.EXPONENTIAL,
                    <span class="num">15L</span>,
                    TimeUnit.SECONDS
                )
                .build()
        }
    }
}</code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<style>
  .resilience-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .sync-indicators-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .sync-indicators-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .sync-indicator-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-default, #e2e8f0);
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);

    &.online {
      background: #f0fdf4;
      border-color: #bbf7d0;
    }

    &.offline {
      background: #fffbeb;
      border-color: #fde68a;
    }

    &.syncing {
      background: #eff6ff;
      border-color: #bfdbfe;
    }
  }

  .sync-status-dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;

    &.online {
      background: #16a34a;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.5);
    }

    &.offline {
      background: #d97706;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.5);
    }
  }

  .sync-spinner {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #2563eb;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .sync-status-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    flex: 1;

    strong {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    span {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
  }

  .indicator-badge {
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;

    &.online { background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; }
    &.offline { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
    &.syncing { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
  }
</style>
